        "detail": "<div class=\"detailmodule_html\"><div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\"><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Description:</span><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Brand: FzcSpeed</span><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Product Name: Golf Wooden Tees</span><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Material: Natural Hardwood, Smooth Surface Without Burrs</span><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Specifications: 42mm (approx. 1 5/8&quot;), 54mm (approx. 2 1/8&quot;), 70mm (approx. 2 3/4&quot;), 83mm (approx. 3 1/4&quot;)</span><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Colors: Assorted Colors</span><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Packaging: 50 Tees per Pack</span><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Applicable Scenarios: Driving Range Practice, Suitable for Irons/Woods/Hybrids</span><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Features: Low Spin Shallow Cup Design, High Visibility Colors, Break Resistant Strengthened Treatment</span><br/><br/><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Features:</span><br/><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Professional Grade Durable Material: Made of high strength organic hardwood – impact resistant and break resistant, withstands repeated swings for lasting stability.</span><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Low Spin Design: Shallow cup reduces contact area between the ball and tee, minimizing spin to help you achieve longer, straighter shots.</span><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">High Visibility Colors: Available in fluorescent pink, bright orange, vibrant green, and more – easy to spot on the grass, no more hunting for tees.</span><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Four Height Options: Available in 42mm, 54mm, 70mm, and 83mm – suitable for drivers, irons, hybrids, and various club needs.</span><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">50 Pack Portable Set: Each pack includes 50 tees in a transparent self sealing bag – dust proof and easy to carry, perfect for restocking on the go.</span><br/><br/><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Packing list:</span><br/><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">50*tee</span><br/></div><p style=\"text-align:left;margin:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px\" align=\"left\"><img src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S0be1f6073496444d9beec9b5fccb3276H.jpg?width=1500&amp;height=1500&amp;hash=3000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S36c4fe28480948e199027cdc82bd167a4.jpg?width=1500&amp;height=1500&amp;hash=3000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S74e28f4598164a15b54aa63caf74c5dex.jpg?width=1500&amp;height=1500&amp;hash=3000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sc1b1e6462ac94ec4a8df4f30ac33eb6fb.jpg?width=1500&amp;height=1500&amp;hash=3000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S8a274a6d15e248588995d5520879262aE.jpg?width=1500&amp;height=1500&amp;hash=3000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S62faee769b26498eb48a1046b40fcc58X.jpg?width=706&amp;height=603&amp;hash=1309\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S51252122d95e45bab7356d89e8546b3fg.jpg?width=1500&amp;height=1500&amp;hash=3000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S648eb89522c54a24915800ef47f8df2d5.jpg?width=1500&amp;height=1500&amp;hash=3000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S5640f6097488419f9f7a747f35e487d7h.jpg?width=1500&amp;height=1500&amp;hash=3000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S17d252bd068f49428a0dcb061f85677e2.jpg?width=1500&amp;height=1500&amp;hash=3000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/></p></div></div><br/>"
